WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The floor-plan studio. Rearrange an ED floor plan against a brief, save three options, draw the winner to scale.

2
00:00:03.514 --> 00:00:07.675
1 · Pick a topic from the tabs along the top.

3
00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:11.044
This line tells you what to do on each topic.

4
00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.448
2 · Change a control. The picture changes as you go.

5
00:00:13.448 --> 00:00:16.415
Watch the numbers update too.

6
00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:20.211
3 · Read the notes. The Exam line is what to write in the exam.

7
00:00:20.211 --> 00:00:25.581
4 · When you are ready, open Test yourself and press Check.

8
00:00:25.581 --> 00:00:29.367
Stuck? Ask Allen. He can see this machine and show you.
